 Chapman .</p><p>Christ Reflected in Creation.</p><p>By D.C. M cMillan .</p><p>How the Inner Light Failed.</p><p>N ewell Dwight Hillis .</p><p>The Man Who Wanted to Help.</p><p>By J. S. K. M cCclure .</p><p>Young Men in History.</p><p>By F. W. G unsaulus .</p><p>St. Paul. An Autobiography.</p><p>Faith Building.</p><p>By W m. P. Merrill .</p><p>The Dearest Psalm and the Model Prayer.</p><p>By H enry Ostrom .</p><p>The Life Beyond.</p><p>By M rs. Alfred Gatty .</p><p>Mountain Tops with Jesus.</p><p>T heodore L. Cuyler .</p><p>The Hidden Years of Nazareth.</p><p>G. C ampbell Morgan .</p><p>Where He Is.</p><p>C leland B. McAfee .</p><p>Environment.</p><p>By J. G. K. M cClure .</p><p>Nutshell Musings.</p><p>By A mos R. Wells .</p><p>I Go a Fishing.</p><p>By W m. E. Barton .</p><p>Upon the Sunroad.</p><p>By B ishop Hurst .</p><p>18mo, cloth, each, 25 cents .</p><p>F leming H. Revell Company</p><p>CHICAGO NEW YORK TORONTO</p><p>PUBLISHERS OF EVANGELICAL LITERATURE</p>",
